The {{LSLP|message}} is prefixed with information about the prim sending the email.
{{{!}}{{Prettytable}}
{{!}}-{{Hl2}}
!Template
!Example
{{!}}-
{{!}}<pre>
Object-Name: *prim*
Region: *simname* (*simpos.x*, *simpos.y*)
Local-Position: (*primpos.x*, *primpos.y*, *primpos.z*)

