|func=llDetectedRot|return_type=rotation|p1_type=integer|p1_name=number
|func_footnote=Returns {{LSLG|ZERO_ROTATION|<0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0>}} if {{LSLP|number}} is not valid sensed object.
