|func_footnote=Returns an empty string if the header is not found, if the '''request_id''' is not a valid key received through the [[http_request]] event, or if the headers can no longer be accessed. Headers can only be accessed before [[llHTTPResponse]] is called and with-in the first 30&nbsp;seconds after the [[http_request]] event is queued.
