|helpers=
=== Helper Functions ===
* [[Stamp2UnixInt]] - List format to Unix timestamp. ex: [2009, 2, 13, 3, 31, 30] to 1234567890
** compatible with '''''llParseString2List( llGetTimestamp(), ["-", "T", ":", "."], [] )'''''
