|func_footnote
|func_desc=Gets the [http://json.org JSON] type for the value in {{LSLPT|json}} at the location {{LSLPT|specifiers}}. 
|Return_text=specifying the type of the value at {{LSLPT|specifiers}} in {{LSLPT|json}}.
