See: [http://www.lslwiki.net/lslwiki/wakka.php?wakka=llSensor llSensor] for an excellent explanation of {{LSLP|arc}}.
|func_desc=Performs a scan for {{LSLP|name}} and {{LSLP|id}} with {{LSLP|type}} within {{LSLP|range}} meters and {{LSLP|arc}} radians of forward vector and repeats every {{LSLP|rate}} seconds. The first scan is not performed until {{LSLP|rate}} seconds have passed.

Script execution continues immediately. Whenever a scan is completed, a [[sensor]] or [[no_sensor]] event is put in the event queue.
