|notes=This function was introduced in conjunction with new [[llSetPrimitiveParams|primitive parameter]] constants: [[PRIM_ALLOW_UNSIT]], [[PRIM_SCRIPTED_SITS_ONLY]], and [[PRIM_SIT_TARGET]].
